le=\"color:#559b43; text-decoration:none\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"0\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"5TEfuz1B\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #559b43;\">Green Street News Australia</span></a> and gain access to daily exclusive stories and critical market intelligence hours before anyone else.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:125%\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:125%\">With 60+ years of reporting experience and a historical library of 25+ years, Green Street News Australia is driven to become the only globally dedicated CRE news platform you can rely on for&nbsp;trusted, on-the-ground expertise.&nbsp;Our team in Sydney and Melbourne delivers breaking Australian commercial real estate news straight to your inbox, helping you make informed decisions faster.</p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:150%\"></ul></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#000000; word-break:break-word; padding:0px 20px 10px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17054436838107\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate!important\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#559b43\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#000000; word-break:break-word; border-radius:4px; cursor:auto; background-color:#559b43; mso-padding-alt:12px 18px\">\n        <a href=\"https://info.greenstreetnews.com/free-trial\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00a4bd; font-size:16px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; Margin:0; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0px; text-decoration:none; padding:12px 18px; display:block\" data-hs-link-id=\"1\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"jbSsz+Vf\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;font-style:normal;\">Request for a free trial</strong>\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17465481528522\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table class=\"hse-image-wrapper\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"hs_padded\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; color:#000000; word-break:break-word; text-align:center; padding:10px 20px; font-size:0px\">\n        <a href=\"https://info.greenstreetnews.com/free-trial\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00a4bd\" data-hs-link-id=\"2\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"RXc1Oyvi\">\n        <img alt=\"Green Street News Aus Banner 2(May campaign)\" src=\"https://info.greenstreet.com/hs-fs/hubfs/Green%20Street%20News%20Aus%20Banner%202(May%20campaign).png?width=1120&amp;upscale=true&amp;name=Green%20Street%20News%20Aus%20Banner%202(May%20campaign).png\" style=\"outline:none; text-decoration:none; border:none; max-width:100%; font-size:16px\" width=\"560\" align=\"middle\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#000000; word-break:break-word; padding:10px 30px 0px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_17465482151963\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"w